  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.0-3r.next": "再请求一次",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.0-4r.char": "[sine]对不起，打扰您了……[/sine]\n可是，哪怕只有一点线索也好。指挥官还在港区……我想回到他身边。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.0-4r.next": "继续",
