  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.0-attack": "Architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.char": "建筑师先生，又、又来打扰您了……上次走不通的路，我都记在日记里了。这次……能请您告诉我，怎样才能回到港区吗？",
