  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "解释",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-2r.char": "我、我知道光写日记不够……可我不想忘记走过的路，也不想忘记港区。总有一天，我想把找到归路的那一页，亲手翻给指挥官看。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-3r.ancient": "你连声音都在发抖，还要继续？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-3r.next": "鼓起勇气",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-4r.char": "[sine]是、是的……我还是很害怕。[/sine]\n不过，我不想让他们等不到我。只要还有没找过的地方……雅努斯就再试一次。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JANUS_SPIRE2_CHARACTER_JANUS_CHARACTER.1-4r.next": "继续",
